  "implemented": [
    "Cylinder location scales by the explicitly supplied unit factor; direction uses the existing native normalization arithmetic.",
    "Cone offset evaluates tan(pi/2 - semiAngle) * radius * unitScale in the recovered order; scaled origin subtracts the first-normalized direction times this offset.",
    "Cone direction is normalized again after origin construction, retaining the observed second-pass rounding behavior.",
    "Finite snapshot validation and detached outputs preserve precise geometry. The result reports extentWritten:false and has no length or endpoint."
  ],
